<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of December 2 to December 6, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreign investors have been net buyers for the past four weeks.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, were as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   517.40 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  504.90 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net buying			  12.51 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week's net buying    19.99 billion yen</p>
</text>
